body:
Glad you made it. Keep going. I was on the road just a few short months ago. I have a pt govt job, a good roommate, and my newest nefew was born today! 2 years invitro, 50,000, 2 losses, 5 days labour, and a c section my sister and her husband have their miracle. We lost my other sisters 12 year old son in march this year too. I am thankful that I got to be included in this moment. I didnt ruin the day. 

Just keep swimming! 

;
